sequenceDiagram
    title UC13 通知中心与站内私信——对象级顺序图
    participant P0 as 用户
    participant P1 as NotificationCenter/PrivateMessages.vue
    participant P2 as AiController/PrivateMessageController
    participant P3 as NotificationCenterServiceImpl
    participant P4 as PrivateMessageServiceImpl
    participant P5 as Notification/MessageMapper
    P0->>P1: 查看通知或发送私信
    P1->>P2: 调用 notification/private-message 接口
    P2->>P3: list/markRead/unreadCount
    P3->>P5: 查询或更新通知
    P2->>P4: listConversation/sendMessage
    P4->>P5: 校验接收者并写消息
    P5-->>P4: 返回记录
    P4-->>P2: 返回会话/未读数
    Note over P0,P5: 用户只能读取自己的通知和会话；通知失败不回滚核心交易。
